<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>12 / 自进化与扩展</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>时效更新：新试题、新套路与教材改版</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={160} viewBox='0 0 1140 160'><rect x='0' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#0E2340' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='95.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>发现</text><text x='95.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>公开且适合使用的题源</text><line x1='197' y1='84' x2='223' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M223 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='237' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='332.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>下载</text><text x='332.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>保存出处与原文件</text><line x1='434' y1='84' x2='460' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M460 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='474' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='569.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>内部解析</text><text x='569.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>步骤与答案校验</text><line x1='671' y1='84' x2='697' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M697 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='711' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='806.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>审核入库</text><text x='806.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>教研核实</text><line x1='908' y1='84' x2='934' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M934 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='948' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='1043.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>对外展示</text><text x='1043.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>标注来源与使用范围</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>五阶段管道</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>发现 / 下载 / 内部解析 / 审核入库 / 对外展示；来源可访问不等于可以任意再发布</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>是否新建套路或步骤</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>同一路径换数字记为变式；出现新组合交教研核实；词表不能表达的操作提出候选新步骤；涉及新增课程内容先核对教材</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 366, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>教材改版五类变更</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>新增 / 删除 / 迁移 / 拆分 / 合并；旧版与新版可并存，历史掌握记录重新映射时保留依据与不确定性</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #E8A33D', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>不能仅因题面新、文字不同或模型匹配置信度低就自动创建新套路；课时总量、知识点集合和顺序都应随所选版本维护，不能将当前暂定数量当成永久常数</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：自进化与跨学科扩展设计.md §4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 119 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>